Magic marker - when you write on a cursed scroll with a blessed marker,
it turns out uncursed.  Uncursed scroll + blessed marker = blessed.
Obviously blessed + blessed = blessed, but this means you can't write
cursed scrolls with a blessed marker.  Thus, uncursed markers are more
useful.  As other posts in this thread have noted, cursed scrolls are
often very handy; I don't believe anyone's mentioned the cursed scroll
of gold detection...

